@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+Feature: Todo Creation
+  As a user
+  I want to add new todo items
+  So that I can track tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is open
+
+  Scenario: New todo is created when Enter is pressed
+    When I type "Buy groceries" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then I should see a todo item labeled "Buy groceries" in the list
+    And the new-todo input should be cleared
+
+  Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating a todo
+    When I type "  Walk the dog  " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then I should see a todo item labeled "Walk the dog" in the list
+
+  Scenario: Empty input after trimming does not create a todo
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then the todo list should be empty
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Then the #main section should not be visible
+    And the #footer section should not be visible
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are shown when a todo exists
+    When I create a todo named "Buy groceries"
+    Then the #main section should be visible
+    And the #footer section should be visible
\ No newline at end of file
