@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+Feature: Todo Toggle and Completion
+  As a user
+  I want to mark todos as complete or active
+  So that I can track progress
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is open
+    And I have the following todos:
+      | title          |
+      | Buy groceries  |
+      | Walk the dog   |
+      | Write report   |
+
+  Scenario: Clicking the checkbox marks a todo as completed
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" should have class "completed"
+    And the todo's checkbox should be checked
+
+  Scenario: Clicking a completed todo's checkbox marks it active
+    Given the todo "Buy groceries" is completed
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" should not have class "completed"
+    And the todo's checkbox should not be checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete toggles all todos
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then every todo should have class "completed"
+    And the toggle-all checkbox should be checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete unchecks all when all are already completed
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then no todo should have class "completed"
+    And the toggle-all checkbox should not be checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox updates when individual todos are toggled
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Walk the dog"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Write report"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox should be checked
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes only completed todos
+    Given the todo "Buy groceries" is completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then I should see 2 todos in the list
+    And I should not see a todo named "Buy groceries"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button should not be visible
\ No newline at end of file
